{% comment %}
  ATRAMENTI HOW IT WORKS  ·  Forest & Amber

  Layout family: numbered vertical spine. Deliberately not three equal
  columns (Section 9.C bans the three-identical-cards feature row) and not
  an image plus text split, because the two neighbouring sections already
  use split and marquee.

  Changed:
  - No eyebrow. The eyebrow budget for this page is ceil(6 / 3) = 2 and it
    is spent on the hero and the testimonials.
  - Dropped the uppercase micro-labels (Auswahl / Gestaltung / Lieferung)
    above each title for the same reason. The numeral in the spine carries
    the sequence, which is real information on a process.
  - Dropped the decorative SVG progress rings around each number.
  - Bottom CTA relabelled from "Jetzt starten" to "Labor betreten" so the
    page has exactly one label for the start-the-configurator intent.
  - Its own Google Fonts <link> removed; fonts are self-hosted globally.
{% endcomment %}

<section class="atm atm-section atm-how" id="so-entsteht-dein-duft">
  <div class="atm-wrap">
    <header class="atm-how-head atm-reveal">
      <h2 class="atm-display atm-h2">
        So entsteht dein
        <strong>Duft.</strong>
      </h2>
    </header>

    <ol class="atm-how-steps">
      <li class="atm-how-step atm-reveal">
        <div class="atm-how-marker">
          <span class="atm-how-num">1</span>
        </div>
        <div class="atm-how-body">
          <span class="atm-how-icon">{% render 'atm-icon', name: 'drop' %}</span>
          <h3 class="atm-how-title">Wähle deine Essenzen</h3>
          <p class="atm-body atm-how-text">
            Stöbere durch 28 Nischen-Düfte und stelle deine persönliche Formel zusammen, aus 9
            Einheiten deiner Wahl.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="atm-how-step atm-reveal" data-atm-delay="90">
        <div class="atm-how-marker">
          <span class="atm-how-num">2</span>
        </div>
        <div class="atm-how-body">
          <span class="atm-how-icon">{% render 'atm-icon', name: 'pen-nib' %}</span>
          <h3 class="atm-how-title">Design dein Etikett</h3>
          <p class="atm-body atm-how-text">
            Gib deiner Kreation einen Namen, wähle Symbole, Typografie und Finish. Ein Etikett, so
            einzigartig wie dein Duft.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="atm-how-step atm-reveal" data-atm-delay="180">
        <div class="atm-how-marker">
          <span class="atm-how-num">3</span>
        </div>
        <div class="atm-how-body">
          <span class="atm-how-icon">{% render 'atm-icon', name: 'package' %}</span>
          <h3 class="atm-how-title">Dein Labor kommt zu dir</h3>
          <p class="atm-body atm-how-text">
            Innerhalb von 48 Stunden erhältst du dein persönliches Duftlabor. CO<sub>2</sub>-neutral
            verpackt und fertig zum Mischen.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="atm-how-foot atm-reveal">
      <a href="/pages/konfigurator" class="atm-btn atm-btn--primary">
        Labor betreten
        {% render 'atm-icon', name: 'arrow-right' %}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .atm-how-head {
    max-width: 22ch;
    margin-bottom: clamp(48px, 6vw, 84px);
  }

  .atm-how-steps {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .atm-how-step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 56px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(20px, 3vw, 40px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px);
  }

  .atm-how-step:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* The spine: hairline through the marker column, stopping at the last step. */
  .atm-how-marker {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .atm-how-step:not(:last-child) .atm-how-marker::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 46px;
    bottom: calc(-1 * clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px));
    left: 50%;
    width: 1px;
    background: var(--atm-line);
  }

  .atm-how-num {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border: 1px solid var(--atm-line-strong);
    border-radius: var(--atm-r-ctl);
    background: var(--atm-bg);
    font-family: var(--atm-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--atm-accent);
  }

  .atm-how-body {
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .atm-how-icon {
    display: block;
    font-size: 26px;
    color: var(--atm-accent);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .atm-how-title {
    font-family: var(--atm-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.4vw, 30px);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--atm-ink);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .atm-how-text {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 46ch;
  }

  .atm-how-text sub {
    font-size: 0.75em;
    vertical-align: baseline;
  }

  .atm-how-foot {
    margin-top: clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px);
    padding-top: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--atm-line);
  }

  /* Asymmetric on wide screens: content is offset, not centred. */
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .atm-how-step {
      grid-template-columns: 56px minmax(0, 620px);
      margin-left: 8%;
    }

    .atm-how-head {
      margin-left: 8%;
    }

    .atm-how-foot {
      margin-left: 8%;
      max-width: 720px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .atm-how-step {
      grid-template-columns: 40px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .atm-how-num {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .atm-how-step:not(:last-child) .atm-how-marker::after {
      top: 40px;
    }

    .atm-how-foot .atm-btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>

